---
const kinderImg = "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ba5d94c5/images/e6a9a2db2_image-1024.webp";
const appartImg = "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ba5d94c5/images/81d323c05_image-1024.webp";
---

<section id="projecten" class="bg-dark py-[112px]" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:p4vf90">
  <div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:87xa5c">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end gap-8 mb-16" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:87xa5b">
      <div class="max-w-[700px]" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:87xa5a">
        <span class="text-primary text-[14px] font-bold tracking-[2px] uppercase block mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkzm">Onze Projecten</span>
        <h2 class="text-[42px] font-normal text-white mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:snme7p">Recente projecten</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-dark-muted" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:ns5och">
          Van kinderopvang tot appartementen — A.S.P Aannemersbedrijf levert elk project op met vakmanschap, oog voor detail en trots op het resultaat.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/#contact" class="px-6 py-3 border-2 border-primary text-primary text-[14px] font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all duration-300" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:uw3l1f">
        Neem contact op
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:87xa59">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-dark-border/20 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-dark-border group reveal" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:87xa58">
        <div class="relative aspect-[620/380] overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gye4">
          <img src={kinderImg} alt="Kinderopvang" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:aq6egu" />
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gye3">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-white text-[12px] font-bold rounded" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkz0">Zakelijk</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-white text-[12px] font-bold rounded" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkyz">Nieuwbouw</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gye2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-dark-muted text-[14px] mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gye1">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
            Haarlem — Fase 1
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[24px] font-bold text-white mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:dz7h03">Kinderopvang</h3>
          <p class="text-dark-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:ns5oci">
            A.S.P realiseerde een moderne kinderopvang in het hart van een nieuw woongebied in Haarlem. Het gebouw combineert een strakke metalen gevelbekleding met warmte van houten lamellen.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-primary font-bold text-[14px] inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:gap-3 transition-all" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:uw3l1g">
            Meer over dit project <span data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkyy">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-dark-border/20 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-dark-border group reveal reveal-delay-1" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gye0">
        <div class="relative aspect-[620/380] overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gydz">
          <img src={appartImg} alt="Appartementen" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:aq6egt" />
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gydy">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-white text-[12px] font-bold rounded" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkyx">Woningbouw</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-white text-[12px] font-bold rounded" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkyw">Nieuwbouw</span>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gydx">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-[12px] font-bold rounded border border-white/20" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkyv">4 foto's</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gydw">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-dark-muted text-[14px] mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:e0gydv">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
            Haarlem — Fase 2
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-[24px] font-bold text-white mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:dz7h04">Appartementen</h3>
          <p class="text-dark-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:ns5ocj">
            Aansluitend op fase 1 verzorgde A.S.P de volledige ruwbouw en afbouw van een modern appartementencomplex in Haarlem. Strakke baksteengevels, ruime balkons en hoogwaardige afwerking.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="text-primary font-bold text-[14px] inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:gap-3 transition-all" data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:uw3l1h">
            Bekijk alle foto's <span data-ps="src/components/home/RecentProjects.astro:4dzkyu">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
